# Portfolio contracts

When these files are in play, read `../.contracts/` (`/Users/ye/Documents/GitHub/.contracts/`). Start with its README, then `inventory/ports-and-processes.md`.

Honor stamps: Observed / Interface / Decision / Intent.

HyperTransfer is a native Mac window. It binds UDP 24764 on the Thunderbolt bridge for the 64-byte queue-pair record, then closes that socket. File bytes stay off it. A further port gets a row in that inventory in the same change, and a `health` URL only when the path is real. `check` is `pgrep -x HyperTransfer`. A child stop signals only the pid this card spawned.

This rule is glob-gated. It does not apply to a tooltip or a hash change.
